 comprises:","options":{"A":"Only strikes","B":"Grievance redressal, negotiation and participation","C":"Only courts","D":"Only rules"},"answer":"B"},{"q":"The credibility of PNM/JCM/PREM depends on:","options":{"A":"Delaying them","B":"Breaking them","C":"Honouring them","D":"Hiding them"},"answer":"C"},{"q":"The ultimate beneficiary of good railway industrial relations is:","options":{"A":"Uninterrupted national service","B":"Conflict","C":"Stagnation","D":"Disruption"},"answer":"A"},{"q":"The three pillars of railway industrial relations are:","options":{"A":"Only courts","B":"Only strikes","C":"Only PNM","D":"PNM, JCM and PREM together"},"answer":"D"}]